# PICT negative testing: each ~ value is an invalid/error choice.
# PICT ensures no test row has more than one negative value.
# Unlike transfer.model, this model needs no IF constraints to isolate errors.
From:     Valid, ~Frozen, ~Missing
To:       Valid, ~Missing, ~SameAsFrom
Amount:   Normal, ~Zero, ~OverBalance, ~OverLimit
Currency: Same, Different
